{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_elysm_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_elysm_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"漫長旅途","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_elysm_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"b08b0ff9900deb6ed5062067a2d58752f3e87eb8b81acd436dafb3db02221309","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"極境停留在一個小鎮上為成為一名信使而努力，危機卻在此時悄然而至。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，你的信我放在這了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"下午我要去城裡一趟，如果有什麼要代購的東西，可以在我出發前寫在這張購物單上，過期不候，大家注意啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，這麼快回信就到了！多謝你了，極境小哥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你又要去城裡了？還是為了你那台什麼發......發信器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"正式名稱是信號發射接收一體器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然是二手的，發信範圍不算很大，但你看這機箱，這塗裝配色，不覺得和我的穿搭配起來剛剛好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我可搞不懂你那什麼時尚品味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"小夥子，也幫我帶點城裡的煙草，就和上次的一樣就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還想要一個城裡最近流行的捲髮棒，能拜託你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"好說好說，是要最新款的那個捲髮棒對吧，我記下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"喂小夥子，還有我的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？上次是誰讓我帶煙草，結果轉頭就被家人發現，零用錢都被沒收了？我可是都記著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"按我的記憶力來看，再過個大約四五十年，應該就能把上次的事情忘掉了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......你這也記太久了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，現在的年輕人真是管得寬又囉嗦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你別理他！醫生都說他不能再這麼抽煙了，還是不聽勸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，這是買捲髮棒的錢，那就拜託你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，保證給你挑個款式最好看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就出發了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"narration","text":"這已經是離開家鄉的第幾個年頭？\n第三年？不對，第三年他身在哥倫比亞，之後又繼續向北邊走，到了薩米。\n要再往北時，被那些居住在冰天雪地中的雪祀攔下了，於是他只好轉變方向，繼續旅途。\n一個健康的成年人，還會點源石技藝，不太挑剔的話，日子就不會很難過。\n如果旅費告罄，就在當地找份工作，攢夠了錢再出發。一路走走停停，極境如願看過種種風景。\n有些地方富庶繁華，也有地方貧瘠蠻荒。\n在這座小鎮停下，倒也不是因為這裡有什麼特別之處。\n只是走了這麼久，想要找個地方歇歇腳而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"最新款的捲髮棒，還有......嗯，這麼一小包煙草應該還不至於影響健康，沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"發信器還差最後一個配件，這種增幅器真有點不太好找。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"......是錯覺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"總覺得這天有點不太對勁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙面怪人","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這天氣......看起來有點不對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，兄弟你也這麼覺得？這就叫英雄所見略同吧，我也覺得有點怪怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"看你這打扮，應該不是尋常人士吧？說你剛打劫這家店還沒來得及逃跑估計都有人信，不管你賣的是什麼，我猜今天都沒賣出去多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙面怪人","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......不勞你操心。我們本來也不是單純的店鋪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，但你們這不是有商品嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙面怪人","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沉默的女士”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是準備要推廣的預防藥劑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"預防藥劑？真有這麼厲害，該不會是預防礦石病的吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"據說真正有效果的預防藥貴得嚇人，除了那些有錢人，真正需要用的人基本上都用不起，市面上的那些藥大多都沒什麼效果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，但我看人還蠻準的，我覺得你們不像是賣假貨的，難不成是真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沉默的女士”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沉默的女士”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你能聽見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沉默的女士”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你話真多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"請稱這為熱情。熱情可是與人友好相處的良方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"特別是和兩位這樣看起來就挺危險的人物交流，萬一我現在其實看到了什麼不該看的，比如來歷不明的預防藥什麼的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"至少一會你們決定揍我的時候下手會輕一點吧，至少那邊那個蒙著臉的小哥應該會心軟的，我能確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙面怪人","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......不我不會。我會對著你的臉揍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"誠實點，別害羞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"不過現在，我覺得你們不太像什麼假藥集團或者走私集團了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沉默的女士”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"本來就不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沉默的女士”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們是......製藥公司。負責解決感染者問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"是解決感染者，還是解決問題？——換個人我可能就這麼問了，不過我覺得你們應該可信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙面怪人","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的最好小心點，你長嘴就是為了被揍的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"暴力可不好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，耽擱了這麼久，我也該走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟，我看你和這邊這位都不適合當前台，記得換個人啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙面怪人","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"快走吧你，要你多管閒事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沉默的女士”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沉默的女士”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"接著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哇哇！怎麼忽然暗器傷人......嗯？這是，預防藥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"是要送給我？這多不好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“沉默的女士”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"三塔勒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"結果還是要收錢？！雖然是不貴啦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙面怪人","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙面怪人","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛那個人，應該不是在自言自語吧？難道他是在和隊長您說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的女士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙面怪人","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"但是隊長您......這不可能啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的女士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的女士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思啊，這位客人，你要的這款增幅器我們這沒貨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"不是吧老闆，你這是我最後的希望了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"真的沒有了？在倉庫的角落裡放太久一時沒找到什麼的......有沒有這種可能性？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能找的地方我都替你找過了，而且我們進貨賣貨都是有記錄的，白紙黑字，錯不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你這也不是第一次來了，這次還是為了上回說想要修的那台機器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯！看我的信號發射接收一體器！這些改裝都是我親手完成的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然之前都沒怎麼接觸過這方面的知識，但是一邊自學一邊改裝意外的順利，哎呀，就連我本人也有點被自己的學習能力嚇到了呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"只要能找到合適的增幅器，它的性能就能夠再拔高一個檔次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，你看我去做個信使怎麼樣？正好我的源石技藝也挺合適的，我這樣的人才浪費了可惜啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，信使可不是拼台發信器就能當的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"還要考試對吧？不瞞你說，老闆，我以前在家鄉的時候可是人稱學界突擊四天王之一......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等會，這什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"就是特別擅長應付考試的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，別貧了，說正經的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要的這型號平時用的不多，不過你要是能再等一陣子，我可以幫你試試看能不能搞到貨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"完全沒問題，我最近一段時間都會留在附近的鎮子裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"那就這麼說定了，隔段時間我再來——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電台廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——緊急通知，緊急通知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"電台廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下面為廣大市民插播一條即時速報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"看得這麼認真，老闆，是誰的信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別吵，別打擾我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！行了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什麼行了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，八成是和極境那個小夥子有關，我看信封上的署名，像是之前那個調去大城市的什麼信使老爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是天災信使老爺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極境小哥來我們鎮上時間也不短了，我想著也不能讓他總是租我們的小房間住，租房的開銷也不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我就寫信去問了問，天災信使老爺回信說，同意讓極境小哥搬進他那棟房子裡住了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......他能有這麼好心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在說什麼，什麼天災信使老爺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我們鎮不是一直沒有信使來著？我記得極境他上次還說，搞不好他會成為小鎮的常駐信使啥的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個......其實，之前我們還是有過一位天災信使老爺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮上當初希望能把人留下，還特地分了房子給天災信使老爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些老爺們哪會願意在我們這種小地方待著，沒留多久，人就走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"想起來就滿肚子氣，不說了，我先走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也怪不了別人，大城市能開出來的酬金，比我們這種偏遠小鎮要高得多，人家要走，誰都攔不住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，要走就走吧，我們還不稀罕呢！而且，現在不是有極境那小子嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"他都提前給自己取什麼工作代號了，還非說專業信使的第一步就是從起一個帥氣的代號開始，應該不是開玩笑的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，但願是這樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，你有沒有感覺，好像有點不對勁......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！不好了！快出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"外面、外面的天變了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_warehouse"},{"type":"narration","text":"經由本市天災信使觀測，接下來數小時內，我市西南方向有天災雲生成，屬地域突發性天災，將會在局部範圍內造成影響。\n本次突發性天災不會威脅本市安全，現緊急通知各位市民，請在接下來幾日之內謹慎出行，注意保護自己的人身安全。\n尤其是將要前往西南方向的市民，為了自身安全，請務必重新規劃行程。\n重複播報一遍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西南方向不是我進貨要走的地區，應該不用太在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會影響小哥你要的貨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，我先把買增幅器要用的錢放這了！一定要記得幫我進貨，我會來取的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂等等？！小哥，你跑什麼啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"不跑不行，這次可是名副其實的和天災賽跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"narration","text":"現在返回，意味著巨大的風險。\n極境忍不住問自己：他和那座小鎮的感情有深厚到這種地步嗎？\n難說。他心想，其實還不至於，怎麼就到願意冒生命危險這麼誇張的地步了，只是個住了幾個月的小鎮罷了。\n只是他同時也清楚，要就這麼站在旁邊看著，等一切風平浪靜之後再採取行動，這事自己絕對做不到。\n既然如此，那就乾脆別想那些做不到的事了。\n現在更應該集中精神，好好想想有哪些是他能做的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_thundercloud"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"害怕的孩童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽，天上怎麼有那麼大一片雲，我害怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無措的母親","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別、別怕，我們現在就去找你爸爸，別怕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛那是地震？！我們現在該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰能幫我把這塊板子移開，這東西忽然砸下來，我的腿，我的腿動不了了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstrongpoint"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"等著！我這就來幫忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事，這到底是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"天災，是天災！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"上一回也是這樣！快逃，必須得立刻離開，走得越遠越好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"真是一場完美的英雄救美，如果我做評委，剛剛那個轉身的動作我一定會給十分滿分，你們覺得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極境小哥......！你、你受傷了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼在這，你不是去城裡了嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，小傷而已，沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"冥冥之中，我察覺到有人需要我的幫助——好吧，我收到這邊可能被天災波及的消息，就趕回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，是不是很夠義氣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你、你這個傻貨！呆鳥！誰要你這種時候回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"等會，怎麼還罵起人來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"玩笑到此為止，現在不是說這些的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩幾位儘量通知鎮上的所有人，現在立刻準備轉移......這樣的突發性天災勢頭太猛，再不避難就真的來不及了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我們要去哪裡避難？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"如果各位相信我的話，就交給我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是野外生存專家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"大家跟緊我！注意不要走散了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"天災環境下空氣中的源石濃度會急劇升高，強風中也可能帶有一些活性顆粒，大家注意儘量不要裸露皮膚，不要讓身上有任何傷口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，剛剛你的傷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，我有秘密武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（之前那支藥劑居然真的要派上用場了，這誰想得到啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（但願他們賣的真的不是假藥。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"大家再堅持一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"目的地......就在這前面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"把上面的這扇門封緊......好了，這樣應該暫時安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡是地下避難所？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，是已經被廢棄了的避難設施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來沒聽說過還有這麼個地方，你居然能找到這裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"不是我自誇，論認路沒多少人能比得上我，為了繪製這附近的地圖，我可是把周邊的荒野全都用腳丈量了一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"可以說，這裡沒有我不認識的地方，就算是尋找多年前已廢棄的避難所也不在話下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我的意思是，你們現在可以多誇誇我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？呃......太帥了，極境小哥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"對對，就說這種實話就可以了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，確、確實要多謝你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"那現在我們就在這裡等著就行了？大家走得急，都沒帶什麼東西......我們要在這裡待多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"至少要等天災過去，外面的環境恢復正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，一般來說這種突發性的天災來得快去得也快，不會持續太久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果不是你回來了，真難想像我們現在會是什麼狀況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"小事，別客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這次之後，鎮上還是得想點辦法應對之後可能有的危險情況才行，這座避難設施各處都老化了，老實說安全係數不高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這次天災伴有從地層向上生長的晶簇現象，我怎麼也不會選擇這裡，好在沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......看起來我們拿天災毫無辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能提前得知消息的話，至少還有時間準備......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"別太悲觀了，兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我不就是在為了解決這個問題做準備？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"這真是個好消息。對了，你從剛剛起就在搗鼓什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"只是調試一些機器而已，你可以想像成我在試著對方圓幾公里之內大喊“這裡有人，需要支援”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然現在用不上，但是有備無患嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地面在晃，好可怕，到底還要持續多久？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噫！剛剛那是什麼聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像有什麼東西砸下來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"黎博利穿過人群，在這間缺少照明的避難所中，擠滿了小鎮的鎮民。\n孩子歪著頭，被六神無主的母親緊緊摟在懷中，老人們坐在角落，蜷背躬身，像是一尊尊佈滿褶皺的雕塑。\n時不時響起一兩聲壓抑的抽泣，在這裡的人數似乎比他記憶中的要少，極境不敢去想這件事。\n他看向巨響傳來的方向，上方是他們進入避難所的那扇門，陳舊的灰土隨著震動不斷窸窸窣窣地落下，落在極境的臉上。\n這讓他忽然生出一種不好的預感。\n黎博利伸出手，片刻之後，他忽然愣在原地。\n隨著檢查，極境忽然意識到一件事——\n那扇通向外界的門，被坍塌的岩石封死，怎麼也推不開了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"出不去了？！怎麼會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"慌什麼！不就是被塌下來的東西壓住了嗎，到時候我們一起挖出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"大家先別急，別忘了我還有這台發信器，剛剛我已經成功把求救信號發送出去了，現在我們只要等待就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（話是這麼說，但沒有增幅器，能夠發信的範圍相當有限......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（得想點辦法。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（還沒來得及用藥，剛剛受傷的胳膊，有點失去知覺了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（剛才一直在源石粉塵環境裡活動，雖然裹上了衣物，但是這種隔離的效果太差了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（不會這麼倒楣吧？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（不過，如果是在這個情況下，搞不好也算是一種幸運......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面好像安靜下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"好消息，看來天災已經過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有消息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時還沒有，不過有個好消息，經過本人的努力，我們的發信範圍有所突破！再加上天災已經結束，或許很快就會有救援了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"但願如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"極境小哥，你的傷看起來變嚴重了，你說的秘密武器呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......這個嘛，現在還不是用的時候啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"放心放心，有必要的話我會用的，有必要的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"見鬼了，這上面是壓了多少層沙土，根本挖不穿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"吃的喝的都沒有，不能再這麼下去了！外面還沒有消息嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"你先別急，既然這條路走不通，那還是多保存體力吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒法不著急！你的信號都發了多久了？根本沒有任何回音吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"沒人會來救我們！這樣下去，我們所有人都會在這裡餓死，悶死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我有個辦法，如果能聯繫上鄰近的移動城市，可能會有人來救援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"但這破機器的發信範圍根本不可能有那麼遠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，所以這裡就要用上本帥哥的獨家秘法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"但是有一件事一定要注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"從現在開始，讓大家都離我遠點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"離你遠點？你這是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"就是......嗯，字面意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"給我一塊單獨的空間。不要靠得太近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......第幾天了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、不行......我有點撐不住了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"還要等到什麼時候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"發信範圍正在擴大，撐住，我已經有把握了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"沒救了，大家都沒救了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年長的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"留在上面的，和下來的，大家都完了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"別說，咳，這種喪氣話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（再快點，事到如今了......再快點！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（負責解決感染者問題的製藥公司，你們可千萬不能讓我看走眼啊！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（傷口腫脹，應該還有些潰爛。全身都有同感，很像上次被雷姆必拓的車床從身上碾過去的感覺......不對，還是上次更痛。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（源石技藝在不斷增強......雖然使用的同時會引發陣痛。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（這就是感染礦石病的感覺？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"（難得拿到的預防藥，可惜用不上了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼............聲音............"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"有回音了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......回音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"對！回音！有一個基地台，捕捉到了我的信號......並且給了回覆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都聽到了嗎？再撐一撐，有人來救援了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙面怪人","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是這裡沒錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙面怪人","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"真不知道那個信號是怎麼這麼準確地找上我們的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒙面怪人","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島竟然這麼有名了嗎？我們這才活動多久啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的女士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，確認下方有大量生命反應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"準備完畢，隨時可以進行救援！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎......啊，是你啊，極境小哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"早上好啊各位，有一段時間沒見了吧，這裡看起來已經重建好了，真不錯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯......托你的福，我們都沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"那太好了，不枉我這麼努力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"只是簡單先搭個能遮風避雨的屋子，這點活不算難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......你這段時間去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我？我被一群看起來不太像好人的好人拉去治病去了，這次被罵慘了呢，我從來不知道醫生能這麼凶，嚇死人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你的病......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之你先坐，我、我去給你倒杯飲料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"哎等一下，不用這麼麻煩了，我就說兩句話就走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我打算要離開了，這次是來和各位辭行的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你要走了？但你不是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，如果是說留下來當信使那事，不好意思了，就當我毀約吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉啊，看來我還是更想出去看看不一樣的風景，自由的羽翼不該被束縛......怎麼樣，我從你藏著的那本詩集上看來的，是不是很帥氣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，極境小哥，我、我們還沒感謝你救了我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"確實。不就是得病，這也......也沒什麼大不了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是因為感染，所以才要走的話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，好了，大家的心意我收到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"但是鎮上要是住了一個感染者，大家會嚇得不敢說話的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不會怕你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我知道，但這事總歸是有風險的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"別這副表情嘛，其實這也是件好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島，你們還記得嗎？就是來救援我們的那個公司，我這次就是和他們一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"他們還說能給我提供長期治療，這麼好的事到哪找！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們能治得好你的病嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"這個......不好說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小店老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那你還會再回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，有空我一定回來探望各位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你接下來，準備去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"這個嘛，其實我也還不確定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"char_401_elysm","isRemote":false,"text":"暫且跟著羅德島的人走一段路吧，感覺好像會是很不錯的旅途。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_401_elysm","aliases":["極境"]}]}
